# .graphifyignore — what Graphify must NEVER ingest from this repo.
#
# Gitignore syntax; Graphify merges this with .gitignore and evaluates it LAST,
# so it only ever EXCLUDES more (never re-includes).
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: Graphify sends docs/markdown/PDF/image content — and all
# relationship inference / cluster naming — to an EXTERNAL LLM by default
# (Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini) unless pointed at a local Ollama backend. Code is
# extracted locally (tree-sitter). Until this repo is scrubbed for public release
# (see SCHEMA.md §10), keep every secret, raw DB, runtime/live-trading state, and
# personal/ops artifact OUT of any Graphify corpus. Also disable query logging:
#   GRAPHIFY_QUERY_LOG_DISABLE=1   (default log: ~/.cache/graphify-queries.log)

# ── Secrets — never ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.ibkr-paper.env
.ibkr-paper.env

# ── Databases / raw state — never ───────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
state.db
live/state.db

# ── Runtime / operational state — never ─────────────────────────────────────
data/live_runs/
local_ops/
local_logs/
local_runtime/
local_backups/
*.pid
*.tmp

# ── Data + heavy artifacts (also keeps them off the LLM path) ───────────────
data/cache/
*.csv
sweep_results_*.json
experiments.jsonl
*.png
*.jpg

# ── Build / env / caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage*
.git/

# ── Graphify's own output (don't ingest it; don't commit it yet) ────────────
graphify-out/

# ── Live-ops + personal/ops docs: EXCLUDED BY DEFAULT to avoid exfiltrating
#    un-scrubbed IBKR / host / network / account material to a cloud LLM.
#    To map these, FIRST scrub (SCHEMA.md §10) OR use a LOCAL Ollama backend,
#    then delete the relevant lines below. ──────────────────────────────────
OPERATIONS.md
live/
ops/
deploy/
